<rml>
<head>
    <title>Splash</title>
    <link type="text/rcss" href="tokens.rcss"/>
    <link type="text/rcss" href="medallion.rcss"/>
    <link type="text/rcss" href="mark.rcss"/>
    <link type="text/rcss" href="cut.rcss"/>
    <link type="text/rcss" href="splash.rcss"/>
</head>
<!-- THE SPLASH (the menus plan, phase 99; the user, 2026-10-12: "Loading for a few seconds
     before the launher"), as decided on design-canvas://96729e1b, option D, Lockup: the medallion
     over the left end of a carved stone slab, the name filling with gold from the left while the
     program loads, "Developed by Jonathan Barnes" and the loading word along the foot. The slab
     and the gold are drawn layers (assets/ui/brand/, tools/brand_art.mjs); the medallion is the
     shipped Leaf fan with the mark's shader in its disc. Shown only before Play, in the
     launcher's window, for at least a few seconds; the shell takes over as it fades. -->
<body class="splash" id="splash">
    <div class="survey"></div>
    <!-- The launcher's own 960 by 620, centered in the window, which opens maximized
         (the user, 2026-10-13). -->
    <div class="splash-stage">
    <div class="splash-slab"></div>
    <div class="splash-pour" id="splash-pour"><div class="splash-gold"></div></div>
    <div class="md splash-md">
        <div class="ly shadows"></div>
        <div class="ly leaf-l-o1"></div><div class="ly leaf-l-o2"></div><div class="ly leaf-l-i1"></div><div class="ly leaf-l-i2"></div><div class="ly leaf-l-c"></div>
        <div class="ly leaf-r-o1"></div><div class="ly leaf-r-o2"></div><div class="ly leaf-r-i1"></div><div class="ly leaf-r-i2"></div><div class="ly leaf-r-c"></div>
        <div class="ly rim"></div>
        <div class="ly glint"></div>
        <div class="mark splash-mark"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="splash-foot">
        <span class="splash-by">Developed by Jonathan Barnes</span>
        <span class="splash-loading"><span class="splash-pip"></span><span>Loading</span></span>
    </div>
    </div>
</body>
</rml>
